  "claim": {
    "registrationAloneIsSupport": false,
    "published": "synthetic-only-hold",
    "scope": "Hono literal per-verb routes, literal basePath() and a bounded route() graph (same file or relative import) read statically. Verification basis is synthetic-only and promotion is held (HOLD_T19_T23); api.operations, api.request-shape, resource.fetch and codegen.handles are all false. Catalog registration does not make any construct outside supported[] supported.",
    "registration": {
